>> title: Magic Cookie Bars
>> category: Bars & Brownies
>> tags: condensed milk, coconut, chocolate, dessert, oven
>> counters: Bakery
>> aka: seven layer bars, 7 layer bars, hello dolly bars, magic bars, coconut dream bars
>> servings: 24
>> time: 45 min

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C).

Line a #9x13-in pan{} with parchment.

Mix @graham cracker crumbs{1 1/2%cup}(150 g) with @melted unsalted butter{1/2%cup}(115 g).

Press @&(~1)buttered crumbs{} evenly into the pan.

Pour @sweetened condensed milk{14%oz}(400 g) evenly over @&(~1)crust{}.

>> step: scatter over, press down lightly
Scatter @semisweet chocolate chips{1%cup}(170 g), @butterscotch chips{1%cup}(180 g), @shredded sweetened coconut{1 1/3%cup}(110 g), @chopped walnuts{1%cup}(115 g) over @&(~1)filling{}, then press down lightly.

Bake @&(~1)bars{} at 350°F for ~{25%min}.
